<title>SWEDEN: Swedish producer prices rise 0.4 pct in March.</title>
<headline>Swedish producer prices rise 0.4 pct in March.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish producer prices rose 0.4 percent in March from February, Statistics Sweden said on Friday.</p>
<p>(Percentage change)		March '97     yr/yr</p>
<p>Export prices			0.4	    -1.9</p>
<p>Import prices			0.0	    -0.8</p>
<p>Producer prices		    0.4	    -1.0</p>
<p>Note - The market had expected PPI to rise by 0.4 percent in March, for a year-on-year fall of 1.2 percent, according to a Reuters survey.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700-1017</p>
